== Authentication

All endpoints (except health checks) require a valid JWT bearer token issued by the Tanzim identity provider (Keycloak).

[source,http]
----
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>
----

Tokens are obtained via the Driver Authentication endpoint. Access tokens expire and must be refreshed using the refresh token endpoint before expiry.

.Security scheme
[cols="1,2", options="header"]
|===
| Property | Value
| Scheme | HTTP Bearer
| Format | JWT (RS256)
| Header | `Authorization`
|===

