[cols="1,3", options="header"]
|===
| HTTP Status | Meaning in Tanzim context
| 200 | Request processed successfully
| 201 | Resource created (driver, vehicle, trip, zone, etc.)
| 204 | Deleted or deregistered — no response body
| 400 | Validation failure or business rule violation
| 401 | Missing or expired JWT token
| 403 | Token present but insufficient permissions (e.g. driver updating another driver's location)
| 404 | Resource not found (driver, trip, zone, etc.)
| 409 | Conflict — duplicate license plate, active shift already exists, etc.
| 429 | Rate limit exceeded (100 req/min per authenticated user)
