=== Endpoints

==== Book a Trip

`POST /api/v1/trips`

Books a new ride request on behalf of a passenger. This is the entry point for all trip types on the platform. The behaviour after submission depends on the `bookingType` field:

- **IMMEDIATE** (default): The platform begins driver search and dispatch immediately. The trip enters `REQUESTED` → `PENDING` within seconds of the call returning.
- **SCHEDULED**: The booking is confirmed and held in `SCHEDULED` state. The platform will automatically begin driver search in the window leading up to `scheduledTime`. The `scheduledTime` field is required for this booking type.
- **RECURRING**: Behaves like a scheduled trip but generates a new trip instance on each recurrence date according to `recurrencePattern` until `recurrenceEndDate` is reached. The `isRecurring` flag must be `true` and a pattern must be provided.

The fare displayed to the passenger at booking time is an *estimate* sourced from the Pricing Service at the moment of booking. It reflects the current zone rates, active time window, and any surge in effect. The actual fare is calculated at trip completion using the real path driven.

.Business rules
[cols="1,3", options="header"]
|===
| Rule | Detail
| Minimum coordinates precision | Latitude and longitude must be supplied to at least 4 decimal places for accurate driver dispatch and route calculation
| Preferred driver | If `preferredDriverId` is supplied but that driver is unavailable or ineligible, the platform falls back to the nearest available qualified driver without error — the preference is best-effort only
| Scheduled time | Must be at least 15 minutes in the future. Requests with a `scheduledTime` in the past or within the next 15 minutes are rejected with `400`
| Recurring end date | `recurrenceEndDate` must be after `scheduledTime`. Recurring trips without an end date are rejected
| Wallet balance | If `paymentMethod` is `WALLET`, the passenger must have sufficient balance at booking time or the request is rejected with `400`
|===

.Error scenarios
[cols="1,1,3", options="header"]
|===
| HTTP Status | Condition | Resolution
| 400 | Missing required field (`userId`, coordinates, `vehicleType`, or `paymentMethod`) | Supply all required fields
| 400 | `scheduledTime` is in the past or less than 15 minutes from now | Use a future time at least 15 minutes ahead
| 400 | `recurrencePattern` is `CUSTOM` but `recurrenceDays` is empty | Supply at least one day in `recurrenceDays`
| 400 | Passenger wallet balance insufficient for estimated fare | Passenger must top up wallet before booking
| 404 | `userId` does not correspond to a known passenger account | Verify the user ID
| 503 | Pricing Service unreachable — fare estimate could not be generated | Retry; the Pricing Service may be temporarily unavailable
|===

.Required fields
[cols="1,1,3", options="header"]
|===
| Field | Type | Description
| `userId` | integer | The passenger's account ID
| `sourceLatitude` | number | Pickup point latitude (-90 to 90)
| `sourceLongitude` | number | Pickup point longitude (-180 to 180)
| `destinationLatitude` | number | Drop-off point latitude
| `destinationLongitude` | number | Drop-off point longitude
| `vehicleType` | enum | One of the supported vehicle categories
| `paymentMethod` | enum | How the fare will be collected
|===

.Optional fields
[cols="1,1,3", options="header"]
|===
| Field | Type | Description
| `sourceAddress` | string | Human-readable pickup address (for display)
| `destinationAddress` | string | Human-readable destination address
| `bookingType` | enum | `IMMEDIATE` (default), `SCHEDULED`, or `RECURRING`
| `scheduledTime` | datetime | Required when `bookingType` is `SCHEDULED`
| `preferredDriverId` | integer | Request a specific driver (subject to availability)
| `isRecurring` | boolean | Mark trip as part of a recurring schedule
| `recurrencePattern` | enum | `DAILY`, `WEEKLY`, `WEEKDAYS`, `WEEKENDS`, `MONTHLY`, `CUSTOM`
| `recurrenceDays` | array | Days of week for custom recurrence
| `recurrenceEndDate` | datetime | When the recurring schedule expires
| `specialInstructions` | string | Free-text instructions for the driver
|===

