==== Get All Vehicle Types

`GET /api/v1/pricing/vehicle-types`

Returns the list of all vehicle types supported by the pricing engine. Used to populate vehicle selection UIs.

==== Pricing Service Health Check

`GET /api/v1/pricing/health`

Returns a simple status string confirming the pricing service is operational. Used by load balancers and infrastructure monitoring.

